**Latest Updates** (2025-11-02 - VENUE MANAGEMENT & TEACHER PROFILE TEST SUITE - COMPREHENSIVE COVERAGE):

- ✅ **VENUE MANAGEMENT & TEACHER PROFILE TEST SUITE CREATED** (2025-11-02):
  - **Purpose**: Comprehensive test coverage for new venue management and teacher profile features
  - **Test Status**: ✅ **CREATED - 5 NEW TEST FILES**
  - **Overall Coverage**: Unit tests (18 tests), Integration tests (17 tests), E2E tests (4 spec files, 30+ test cases)

  **Tests Created**:
  1. **Integration Tests** (1 file - 17 tests):
     - `/tests/integration/api/Endpoints/VenueEndpointsIntegrationTests.cs`
     - Tests public venue endpoints (GET /api/venues, GET /api/venues/{id})
     - Tests admin CRUD endpoints (POST, PUT, DELETE /api/admin/venues)
     - Validates authentication (401), authorization (403)
     - Validates data visibility (Notes field filtering for public vs admin)
     - Tests validation (required fields, duplicates, field lengths)

  2. **React Unit Tests** (2 files - 18 tests):
     - `/apps/web/src/lib/api/hooks/__tests__/useVenues.test.tsx` (10 tests) ✅ PASSING
     - `/apps/web/src/lib/api/hooks/__tests__/useTeacherProfiles.test.tsx` (8 tests) ✅ PASSING
     - Tests venue fetching, caching, error handling
     - Tests teacher profile parallel fetching with Promise.all

  3. **E2E Tests** (4 files - 30+ test cases):
     - `/apps/web/tests/playwright/admin/venues/venue-creation.spec.ts` (5 tests)
       - Admin can navigate to venue management
       - Create venue with all fields
       - Validate required name field
       - Create with minimal fields
       - Prevent duplicate names

     - `/apps/web/tests/playwright/admin/venues/venue-editing.spec.ts` (7 tests)
       - Edit venue name and directions
       - Update admin-only notes field
       - Toggle active/inactive status
       - Inactive venues visible in admin list
       - Non-admin access blocked
       - Cancel editing discards changes

     - `/apps/web/tests/playwright/events/venue-display.spec.ts` (8 tests)
       - Venue NOT visible to unauthenticated users
       - Venue NOT visible to authenticated users WITHOUT RSVP/ticket
       - Venue visible to users WITH RSVP
       - Venue visible to users WITH ticket
       - Correct venue name and directions displayed
       - Notes field NOT displayed to public
       - Venue hidden when user cancels RSVP

     - `/apps/web/tests/playwright/events/teacher-display.spec.ts` (9 tests)
       - Teachers section appears when teachers assigned
       - Display teacher scene name when available
       - Display teacher bio when available
       - Handle multiple teachers
       - NO section when no teachers
       - Visible to logged-in and logged-out users
       - Prefer scene name over first/last name
       - Handle teacher with no bio gracefully

  **Integration Test Fixes**:
  - Fixed DTO types (was using wrong CreateVenueDto/UpdateVenueDto, now using CreateVenueRequest/UpdateVenueRequest)
  - Fixed authentication (using JWT tokens via GenerateJwtToken instead of cookie-based auth)
  - Fixed status code expectations (DELETE returns 204 NoContent, POST returns 201 Created)
  - Fixed soft delete verification (venue IsActive = false, not deleted from database)

  **Test Execution Status**:
  - Unit Tests: ✅ **ALL PASSING** (18/18)
  - Integration Tests: ⚠️ **NEEDS VERIFICATION** (17 tests created, awaiting execution)
  - E2E Tests: ⚠️ **NEEDS EXECUTION** (30+ test cases created, awaiting execution against Docker environment)

  **Business Value**:
  - Ensures venue data security (Notes field not exposed to public)
  - Validates privacy rules (venue only shown to RSVP/ticket holders)
  - Confirms admin-only access control
  - Verifies teacher profile parallel loading performance
  - Tests edge cases (inactive venues, missing data, multiple teachers)

  **Files Modified**:
  - `/tests/integration/api/Endpoints/VenueEndpointsIntegrationTests.cs` - FIXED and enhanced

  **Files Created**:
